  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "記同窗"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>鄭宇宏</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">『XXX已退出群組』……</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">政治ê談論tī <i>LINE</i>頂kuân leh攪lā，已經hōo人厭siān，阮驚in koh lā--lueh ē bē收山，30幾冬ê同窗情，定著ài koh接suà，mā tsiânn久無見面--ah，趁囡仔歇熱，逐家約束做伙出來行踏。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā hiàng時做伙ê青春記持，khiú一寡仔tńg來弄喙花。Peh-tsiūnn頭殼頂ê歲月，已經無張持kā烏sìm-sìm ê頭毛thuā白；青春幼tsínn ê皮肉，tī tang時偷偷仔tsiânn做犀牛ê戰甲掛tī喙phué mā m̄知影。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鹿谷和雅村是往溪頭、杉林溪ê支線，mā是tsit改其中一个同學ê故鄉，阮頭一回行跤到，姆--à kah in兄哥tī tsia leh生活、趁食，in兜家己種ê杉林溪茶，m̄-nā茶米清芳，順喉甘甜koh ē-tàng lim著in規家口仔ê熱情kah人情味。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一陣人做伙泡茶、食飯、phò-tāu、lim酒、拍牌，uì中國到東南亞koh講tńg來到台灣，講出離開故鄉，為生活趁食、為某囝拍拚ê無ta-uâ，囡仔tī電話當中ê輕輕一聲「爸爸」，擋bē tiâu--ah！親情牽挽ê hit條線，bē輸thīnn tī心肝頭出力leh kā tshuah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">隨人有一句無一句，講出in ê經歷kah心聲。有人因為khang-khuè ê環境，化學藥劑年久月深ê累積，致使身體koh-iūnn bē堪--得，提早退休無可奈何。Hit个經歷過大風大湧ê同學，有衝kah殺ê氣魄，展現tī拍牌kah lim酒ê時tsūn。Tsit个一步穩一步行ê同學，順風順水有hōo某仔囝安心生活ê條件，siáng贏？Iáu未到四枝釘仔釘--lueh m̄知影。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī山林ê行踏，聽鳥仔、蟲thuā、流水ê聲，鼻樹林tháu放tshinn-tshioh ê氣味，看雲尪tī山頂tsiânn做bông霧無仝款ê身段，坐倚水tshiâng、聽自然ê交響曲，趕走mua tī身軀ê àu鬱熱，kā明仔載ê khuì力一斗充hōo飽。&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh4mQtunbXlg3PIRGZkaOBjaeM8OHaH8Tp1M2Rs7WNCaqr-Lr1LUxhBotPGtqOtOSFsViHOgn45Ev00VOt0kN1SbsuFalMKXb_n0luDPzVwi_VmZ_txv2oaUCmPxzXLfTlc7P_OCCIBtYg0DBOVFPxMDJiANmp7ZdNWJwP_azgBfgn3uBbeCDkchbvDngge/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_20.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh4mQtunbXlg3PIRGZkaOBjaeM8OHaH8Tp1M2Rs7WNCaqr-Lr1LUxhBotPGtqOtOSFsViHOgn45Ev00VOt0kN1SbsuFalMKXb_n0luDPzVwi_VmZ_txv2oaUCmPxzXLfTlc7P_OCCIBtYg0DBOVFPxMDJiANmp7ZdNWJwP_azgBfgn3uBbeCDkchbvDngge/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_20.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEho_NJb6Iy6OuvA8Jx7YHRcAyJBoZ6cpxm_7cQvnh2-sQTbq1xBRM5Z1nh77keV8mSsCzoILZi4S0H1b3MH0DGX5mojieJVFOJ7eB7SmA_BgGqfYjnbZsITwtx6ZTPlXVItuyuEulcn5HDEGNMTFPUfWVpFPp1aMQyDO1lqHU4wLvItL4K4xI4P8b-Kw4i2/s1424/370%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEho_NJb6Iy6OuvA8Jx7YHRcAyJBoZ6cpxm_7cQvnh2-sQTbq1xBRM5Z1nh77keV8mSsCzoILZi4S0H1b3MH0DGX5mojieJVFOJ7eB7SmA_BgGqfYjnbZsITwtx6ZTPlXVItuyuEulcn5HDEGNMTFPUfWVpFPp1aMQyDO1lqHU4wLvItL4K4xI4P8b-Kw4i2/w450-h640/370%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br style=\"text-align: left;\" /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b style=\"font-size: large;\">#生活ê藝術 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\n<br /></span></b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-widt